//  BuildSettings.xcconfig
//  Capture
//
//  Committed. Sourced into the Capture app target's build configurations
//  (wired in scripts/generate_project.rb) so a value set here reaches
//  Info.plist via INFOPLIST_KEY_* and is baked into every build INCLUDING an
//  archive — unlike a value read only from ProcessInfo.environment at
//  runtime, which an Xcode scheme's Run action injects but a device install,
//  TestFlight, or CI archive never does (FC-R14).
//
//  POSTHOG_API_KEY defaults to empty here so a fresh checkout with no
//  Secrets.xcconfig still builds — an empty INFOPLIST_KEY_POSTHOG_API_KEY is
//  read by AppConfiguration.postHogAPIKey as "unset" (analytics stays a
//  no-op), mirroring Secrets.swift's `nil`. The optional #include? below
//  layers the real key on top when a gitignored Secrets.xcconfig exists
//  next to this file.

POSTHOG_API_KEY =

#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
